        => CompilationTestHelper.AssertRecordsAtLines($"{form} [G866]", program + "()", records);

    // N9 (PLAN G851; SPEC 8.2.3 "a Contract fact about a Type is evidence for an identical one", 8.3.2's rows): a premise against the
    // closed-world result of the complete constructed Type its subject is identical with is contradictory evidence, the premise's
    // error at the declaration, in every proposition form (a Contract atom, a negative capability, `or`, `not` over a compound, `and`,
    // a projection subject, a generic Contract, Callable) and in either premise order; each invalid row has its valid twin. r3-gcw2 and
    // r3-callw are valid programs N9's check rejects without G866's rule.
